      <li>The client may not reproduce, distribute, publish or trade any materials without the express written consent of Bridge Performance.</li>
      <li>The client obtains only a personal, non-transferable right of use for their own use.</li>
    </ol>

    <h2 id="art10">Article 10 — Liability</h2>
    <ol class="numbered">
      <li>Bridge Performance is liable only for direct damage that is the direct result of a demonstrable failure to perform the agreement.</li>
      <li>Bridge Performance is never liable for indirect damage, consequential damage, loss of profit, missed savings, or damage due to business interruption.</li>
      <li>If Bridge Performance is liable, liability is limited to the amount the client paid for the relevant service, with a maximum of €2,500 per event giving rise to damage.</li>
      <li>Bridge Performance is not liable for damage resulting from incorrect or incomplete information provided by the client, or from the client's lack of the required technical facilities.</li>
      <li>The client indemnifies Bridge Performance against third-party claims arising from the performance of the agreement, to the extent such claims result from acts or omissions of the client.</li>
    </ol>

    <h2 id="art11">Article 11 — Complaints and disputes</h2>
    <ol class="numbered">
      <li>Complaints about the performance of the service must be reported in writing to info@bridgeperformance.nl as soon as possible, and no later than 14 days after the shortcoming was identified.</li>
      <li>Bridge Performance aims to handle complaints within 14 working days. If a longer handling period is needed, the client will be informed.</li>
      <li>If the complaint is not resolved satisfactorily, the consumer may submit a complaint via the EU Online Dispute Resolution platform: <a href="https://ec.europa.eu/consumers/odr">ec.europa.eu/consumers/odr</a>. Bridge Performance is not affiliated with a recognized dispute resolution body.</li>
      <li>Dutch law applies to the agreement. Disputes will be submitted to the competent court in the district of Overijssel, unless the consumer chooses the court of their own place of residence.</li>
    </ol>

    <h2 id="art12">Article 12 — Privacy</h2>
    <p>Bridge Performance processes personal data in accordance with the GDPR. See the <a href="/privacy-policy/">privacy policy</a> for more information on what data is collected, how it is used, and what rights the client has.</p>

    <h2 id="art13">Article 13 — Changes</h2>
